/p></div></div></div></div></a></div><div data-test-id="col" class="mb-3 mb-md-4 px-md-3 col-6"><a data-test-id="card-grid-card-0-1" href="https://www.nationalgeographic.org/support-us/ways-give" target="_self" class="card-light text-decoration-none shadow cardGrid_simple-card__sbYcD h-100 mx-auto text-center cardGrid_simple-card-shadow__rns9l card"><div data-test-id="row" class="g-0 row"><div data-test-id="card-img-container" style="height:375px" class="bg-color-gray-300 overflow-hidden card-img col"><img width="100%" height="100%" class="cardGrid_simple-card-image__LdsgO object-fit-cover" src="https://images.nationalgeographic.org/image/upload/t_ngsmainsite_card_image/NGS%20Main%20Site/Wildlife/2021-10-Serengeti_credit-Michael-Nichols_NG_cc04_adj_1777615" alt="Support Our Work"/></div></div><div data-test-id="row" class="g-0 h-100 row"><div data-test-id="col" class="col"><div class="h-100 d-flex flex-column justify-content-start align-items-start"><div class="cardGrid_simple-card-body__3JsI8 d-flex flex-column gap-3 justify-content-start w-100"><h3 class="card-title h5 fw-medium cardGrid_simple-card-title__3mZ4U" data-test-id="card-title">Support Our Work</h3><p class="card-text cardGrid_simple-card-subtitle__Se2dO" data-test-id="card-text">100% of your donations directly further the impact of Explorers and protect the wonder of our world.</p></div></div></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></section><section><div data-test-id="container" class="callToActionBlock_cta-block-container__Hmmqi w-100 d-flex justify-content-center container"><div class="w-100 d-flex position-relative" style="background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.4), rgba(0,0,0,0.4)), url(https://images.nationalgeographic.org/image/upload/t_ngsmainsite_cta_block/NGS%20Main%20Site/Land/2021-10-FA_Land_Hero_02);background-size:cover;background-position:center;background-repeat:no-repeat;min-height:425px" data-test-id="cta-block-image-container"><div class="tooltip-asset-info-container bottom-0">