nter gap-2 text-uppercase btn btn-primary">Sign Up for Email</a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section><div class="quoteBlock_quote-block__YZSXd quoteBlock_quote-block--yellow__Oet37 w-100" data-test-id="quote-block"><div data-test-id="container" class="p-0 container-fluid"><div data-test-id="row" class="g-0 justify-content-center row"><div data-test-id="quote-block-header-container" class="quoteBlock_quote-block__header-container__Tc4Fk align-items-start align-items-md-center col-md-8 col-sm-12"><div class="quoteBlock_quote-block__header__hsY8C align-items-start align-items-md-center"><p class="quoteBlock_quote-block__label__83TIW text-start text-md-center" data-test-id="quote-block-label">Our Promise</p><h2 class="quoteBlock_quote-block__title__UfL98 text-start text-md-center" data-test-id="quote-block-title">Supporting Conservation for the 21st Century</h2></div></div></div><div data-test-id="row" class="g-0 justify-content-center w-100 row"><div data-test-id="col" class="quoteBlock_quote-block__quotes__WyfkR quoteBlock_quote-block__quotes--full-width__gbmR1 col"><div class="quote_quote-card__aPXDj quote_quote-card--yellow__t9XsG quote_quote-card--has-image__hxfC3 quote_quote-card--image-right__OSDgI" data-test-id="quote-block-quote-0"><div class="quote_quote-card__image__cqYDO" data-test-id="quote-block-quote-0-image"><img src="https://images.nationalgeographic.org/image/upload/t_ngsmainsite_headshot/NGS%20Main%20Site/Home/02_NS119048977_2023EXPLR_Karanth_cr_Alisha_Vasudev_1129_1364" alt="Krithi K. Karanth" class="quote_quote-card__img__jzP_k"/></div><div data-test-id="quote-block-quote-0-content" class="quote_quote-card__content__7ZnjX"><div class="quote_quote-card__mark__k5rjc"><div><img alt="Quote mark" width="24" height="50" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/hollow-black-quote.f2f15b90.svg"/><img alt="Quote mark" width="24" height="50" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/hollow-black-quote.f2f15b90.svg"/></div></div><div class="quote_quote-card__text__QQ99S" data-test-id="quote-block-quote-0-text"><p>“This recognition provides a distinguished global platform to elevate our innovative, impactful and scalable conservation programs while fostering empathy, deepening impact and promoting a collective stewardship of the natural world.”</p></div><div class="quote_quote-card__attribution__fqE83"><div class="quote_quote-card__name__07ZbV" data-test-id="quote-block-quote-0-name">Krithi K. Karanth</div><div><div class="quote_quote-card__role__5CtaX" data-test-id="quote-block-quote-0-role">2026 Rolex National Geographic Explorer of the Year</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section><div class="w-100 teaseList_theme-light__Y_ODo" data-test-id="teases-list-bg"><div data-test-id="teases-list" class="teaseList_tease-list-container__nuOCz d-flex justify-content-center flex-column container"><div data-test-id="row" class="g-0 teaseList_tease-list-content__oW65m w-100 row"><div data-test-id="col" class="col-lg-8 col-12"><p data-test-id="tease-list-label" class="teaseList_tease-list-label__OOJHU display-4 mb-4">Our Funding Strategy</p><h2 data-test-id="tease-list-title" class="teaseList_tease-list-title__fR18R fw-medium">Supporting Explorers and Changemakers</h2></div></div><div class="teaseList_tease-list-list__HLvhZ d-flex flex-column"><div class="teaseList_tease__aX3yj teaseList_tease-direction__9TUdX" data-test-id="tease-0"><div class="teaseList_tease-image-block__Bmnlc"><div data-test-id="tease-image" class="teaseList_tease-img-container__pxIQO w-100 overflow-hidden" style="--card-bg-image:url(https://images.nationalgeographic.org/image/upload/t_ngsmainsite_headshot/NGS%20Main%20Site/Grants%20and%20Investments/2024-10-NS119765196_NGS-98110S-23_MediaAssetSubmission_23_)"><img width="100%" height="100%" data-test-id="tease-image-img" class="teaseList_tease-image__fPonB object-fit-cover" src="https://ima