rt grass plains. The short rains have started the grass is green an\"}},\"created_at\":\"2025-04-08T11:18:09Z\",\"created_by\":{\"id\":\"759212413777513\",\"type\":\"accesskey\"},\"folder\":\"NGS Main Site/Wildlife\",\"folder_id\":\"cb0a8f58f4866d2aba12fa640079ec0df3\",\"format\":\"jpg\",\"height\":3361,\"id\":\"074b0ee053d295c39702775b6f81a95e\",\"metadata\":{\"credits\":\"Michael Nichols\",\"short_description\":\"The Serengeti National Park, Tanzania. Mixed herds of zebra and wildebeest flood into the short grass plains. The short rains have started the grass is green and localised waterholes are beginning to fill. Prey is abundant for the Vumbi pride and they can kill game almost daily. Plains or Burchell's zebra, Equus burchelli.\"},\"public_id\":\"NGS Main Site/Wildlife/2021-10-Serengeti_credit-Michael-Nichols_NG_cc04_adj_1777615\",\"resource_type\":\"image\",\"secure_url\":\"https://images.nationalgeographic.org/image/upload/v1744111089/NGS%20Main%20Site/Wildlife/2021-10-Serengeti_credit-Michael-Nichols_NG_cc04_adj_1777615.jpg\",\"tags\":[\"Wildlife\"],\"type\":\"upload\",\"uploaded_by\":{\"id\":\"759212413777513\",\"type\":\"accesskey\"},\"url\":\"http://images.nationalgeographic.org/image/upload/v1744111089/NGS%20Main%20Site/Wildlife/2021-10-Serengeti_credit-Michael-Nichols_NG_cc04_adj_1777615.jpg\",\"version\":1744111089,\"width\":5042},\"subtitle\":\"100% of your donations directly further the impact of Explorers and protect the wonder of our world.\",\"title\":\"Support Our Work\",\"url\":\"https://www.nationalgeographic.org/support-us/ways-give\"}],\"headerPreset\":null,\"label\":\"Get Involved\",\"overview\":null,\"statement\":null,\"title\":\"Ways to Explore With Us\",\"url\":{\"label\":null,\"link\":null}}]}]\n22:[\"$\",\"section\",\"56373d81-dd20-4855-81e4-778e3fd3d669\",{\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L2a\",null,{\"_id\":\"56373d81-dd20-4855-81e4-778e3fd3d669\",\"_type\":\"ngsmain-callToActionBlock\",\"ctaTrigger\":{\"_type\":\"ngsmain